		(uuid "665b022e-f92f-45f9-a2f7-373354b732f4")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN RULES (Rev 2.1, see CLAUDE.md and notes/decisions.md)\n* Fail-secure: every relay energised = connected. Relay GPIOs float at reset, so relays stay off during boot.\n* One star ground: pack negative (NODE0) + logic GND + 12 V return. Heater/load returns straight to the star.\n* Global nets: +12V_IN, +12V, +5V, +3V3, GND, SDA, SCL, ONEWIRE, CELL1_P-CELL4_P, RLY_SEG1-4, RLY_PACK, HTR_EN, LOAD_EN, LOAD_RTN.\n* Local nets: NODE0-NODE4 (Pack path), VSENS1-4, GAS1_CO-GAS4_CO, GAS1_H2-GAS4_H2 (Measurement), SPI/buzzer/buttons (MCU).\n* Modules are header symbols from VentSense_Modules.kicad_sym; verify each module pin order on arrival.\n* E-stop S1 is ONE 2-unit part: unit A on Pack path (pack output), unit B on Power (heater line)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
